      "text": "S → ( S ) S | ε\n\nTwo of these nodes are BOXES: they invoke S again rather than reading input. That self-reference is what makes the language context-free — no finite automaton can match brackets.\n\nRun \"(()())\" and watch the Call row grow and unwind."
